# Clandestine Meddler: "suspect up to one other target creature you control" (CR 115.1, 601.2c, 603.3d): "up to one" lets its controller choose no target. With a Memnite on the battlefield Bot1 picks none, so nothing
# is suspected; a Meddler entering when Bot1 controls no other creature has nothing it could target, and neither it nor anything else is suspected.

